# SQLite databases. The live database lives OUTSIDE the repo (see AGENTS.md);
# nothing here should ever be committed. `db/custom.db` used to be tracked and
# held a pre-user-system schema, which was both dead weight and a data-leak
# risk once real accounts existed.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
/db/
prisma/db/
